    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Using environmental effects like rain and lightning helps set a tone and highlight a character's weakness leading to their inevitably fall. When you @UUID[Compendium.starfinder-field-test-for-pf2e.actions.Item.o8lqmFexiwcaLpu3]{Set the Spotlight} on yourself, you can @UUID[Compendium.starfinder-field-test-for-pf2e.actions.Item.ttL2TstfSqOyzCd2]{Cast a Role} to apply the tragedy role to yourself as a free action. As long as you are in a spotlight with the tragic role, you do not take the role's status penalty and you can use Performance instead of Deception to [[/act feint skill=performance]], even if you are untrained in Deception.</p>",
